        if curr in seen:
            # Zero-sum subsegment detected from the start of the current segment to current position.
            # We must insert a separator.
            # The most efficient way is to consider the current element as the start of a new segment.
            # So we reset the prefix sum to 0 and the seen set to {0}, 
            # but we must include the current element x in the new segment immediately.
